sequenceDiagram
    actor UserQuestion
    participant RetrievalLayer
    participant IndexSurface
    participant GraphRelations
    participant AnswerComposer
    UserQuestion->>RetrievalLayer: ask concrete question in context
    RetrievalLayer->>RetrievalLayer: parse question and infer dominant intent
    RetrievalLayer->>RetrievalLayer: detect topic dimensions and estimate scope
    RetrievalLayer->>IndexSurface: preselect branches and facets
    IndexSurface->>RetrievalLayer: return candidate atoms
    RetrievalLayer->>GraphRelations: gather related nodes and lineage clues
    GraphRelations->>RetrievalLayer: return complementary relations
    RetrievalLayer->>AnswerComposer: rank and select useful subset
    AnswerComposer->>UserQuestion: compose and return answer slice